  "content": "Oh, there\n[E]once was a hero named [B]Ragnar the Red Who came\n[C#m]riding to Whiterun from\n[G#]old Rorikstead And the\n[A]braggart did swagger and [E]brandish his blade As he\n[B]told of bold battles and\n[F#]gold he had made But\n[G]then he went quiet, did [D]Ragnar the Red When he\n[Bm]met the shieldmaiden, Ma-\n[F#]tilda, who said: \"Oh you\n[G]talk, and you lie, and you [D]drink all our mead Now I\n[Bm]think it's high time that you\n[F#]lie down and bleed\" And\n[E]so then came clashing and [B]slashing of steel As the\n[C#m]brave lass Matilda charged\n[G#]in full of zeal And the\n[A]braggart named Ragnar was\n[C#m]boastful no more When his\n[A]ugly red [B]head rolled [E]around on the floor",
